Package: dwellr
Title: Lifecycle Monitoring Analytics for Supply Chain Operations
Version: 0.0.1.9000
Authors@R: person("Ariel", "Rodríguez Herrera", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "ariel.rodriguez.herrera@gmail.com")
Description: Methods for measuring and acting on the time that orders spend in
    each stage of their lifecycle. Covers classical inventory control -- economic
    order quantities, lot sizing, stochastic policies and service levels --
    together with stage dwell estimation under right-censoring, cohort and
    modeled baselines, fill rate on three dimensions, alerting thresholds
    derived from cost ratios, reviewer capacity, routing, and policy
    evaluation. Companion to the book "Lifecycle Monitoring Analytics".
